<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1lɔ</book>
  <para style="h">Timɔte Fɔlɔ Suran</para>
  <para style="toc3">1TI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Timɔte Fɔlɔman</para>
  <para style="toc2">1TI</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kitabu Fɔlɔ Timɔte Ma</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔli Alla la Kuma Kitabu Fɔlɔ Timɔte Ma</para>
  <para style="ip">Judiya le tɛrɛ Timɔte na ri, a kɛra le lemɛniya mɔɔ ri, Kirɛkika le tɛrɛ a fa ri. Pɔli ka Timɔte lɔn a la kelaya taama filana le rɔ, a senin Lisitiri so kɔndɔ, Asi jama kɔrɔ rɔ yɔrɔ mɛn tɔɔ sisɛn ko Turiki (Keladenilu suran 16 kuma diya 1 haan 3). Ka a damira wo lon ma, Timɔte kɛra Keladen Pɔli kɔfɛbilala bɛrɛ ri. Ale le tɛrɛ bilanin a kɔfɛ a la kelaya taama siyaman dɔ. Wo le tɛrɛ, Pɔli tɛrɛ Timɔte lawala soilu la ko do ma siɲa siyaman ko a ye wa jama dɛmɛn lemɛniya rɔ. Wo le rɔ, siɲa siyaman a tɔɔ ye yenna Keladenilu Kɛwaliilu Kitabu yɔrɔ kɔndɔ. Wo misali doilu le ɲinilu ri: Keladenilu suran 17 kuma diya 14 haan 15, suran 18 kuma diya 5, suran 19 kuma diya 22. A tɔɔ ye yenna Pɔli la kitabuilu kɔndɔ. Wo misali doilu le ɲinilu ri: Korɛnti Fɔlɔ suran 4 kuma diya 17 ni suran 16 kuma diya 10 haan 11 a ni Filipikailu suran 2 kuma diya 19 haan 24 ni Tesaloniki Fɔlɔ suran 3 kuma diya 2 haan 6 a ni gbɛrɛilu fanan di. Kitabu fila mɛnilu sɛbɛni Timɔte ma a ni mɛnilu sɛbɛra Tite ma, mɔɔilu ye ii tɔɔ fɔla ko: «Ɲɛmɔɔilu la Kitabu Yɔrɔilu» ka a masɔrɔn ii ye sila le yirakala lemɛniya jama ɲɛmɔɔilu la.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu fɔlɔ mɛn sɛbɛra Timɔte ma, wo ye ko laban sawa kɛndɛ le yirakala: A fɔlɔman ye lemɛniya jama le lalɔnna ka bɛn wuya dinailu ma mɛnilu ye Judiyailu la dina ni joo koilu hankiliilu basanna. Wo wuya dinailu tɛrɛ mɔɔilu karanna le ko dunuɲa fen bɛɛ juuman. Ii kan fanan ko mɔɔ ye kisi sɔrɔnna gbundu lɔnnin le fɛ, mɛn namarani ii le karanden dɔndɔ yɛ. Ii ye tɔnilu fanan siila furu sidi la a ni dɔɔnnifen doilu. Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin ye jamariliilu dila ka bɛn Alla Bato ladɛnnilu ma, a ni lemɛniya jama ɲabɔ ɲa ni a kuntiilu kɛwaliilu la ko. Tɔ la a ye lalilikanilu le fɔla Timɔte yɛ ka bɛn a baaraɲa ma, a tɛrɛ jantoni lemɛniya mɔɔilu fɛ, kosa a ye «kɛ Ɲenematɔmɔnin na baaraden ɲuma ri.» (suran 4 kuma diya 6)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Nde Pɔli, Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na talibidenba le ka ɲin sɛbɛ, ka fara an nakisila Alla la jamarili la, a ni Isa, Ɲenematɔmɔnin, an jii.<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />N ye a sɛbɛla Timote ma, n dencɛ jɛrɛ la lemɛniya rɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">An fa Alla ni an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye hina ni kininkinin ni jususuma di i ma.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wuya dinailu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />N tɛrɛ i madiyala ɲa mɛn ma, n bɔtɔla ka wa Masedoniya jamana rɔ, n ye a fɛ ikɔ tuun, i ye to Ɛfɛsi so kɔndɔ kosa i ye ye mɔɔ doilu jamari ii kana na jama karan ɲa gbɛrɛilu ma. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Ko ii ye fara kankanna talimasɔilu ma, a ni ii buruju tɔɔilu mɛn tɛ banna. Ko su wo ye sɔsɔliilu le lawulila sani ii ye an dɛmɛn Alla la baara kɛla, mɛn ye kɛla lemɛniya rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />N ka jamarili ɲin di le kosa kaninteya ye wara a rɔ mɛn ye bɔla jusu dahanin ni hankili ɲuma ni lemɛniya bɛrɛ rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Sila ra tunun mɔɔ doilu ma ka bila ko fuuilu kɔfɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Ii ye a fɛ ka kɛ sariya karanmɔɔilu ri, kɔni ii ye mɛn fɔla, ka a lase ii sɛɛbɛ jɛrɛ rɔ, ii ma wo lɔn fewu!<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />An ka a lɔn ko sariya ka ɲin, ni a ye labaarala a ɲa ma. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />An ka a lɔn fanan ko sariya ma la mɔɔ telenniilu la ko rɔ, kɔni sariya tiɲanilu ni mɔɔ muruntiniilu ni Alla lɔnbaliilu ni kojuukɛlailu ni sɛnimanbaliilu ni dina mirabaliilu ni fa faalailu ni na faalailu ni mɔɔ faalailu <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />a ni jalonilu ni cɛɛ mɛnilu ye laɲɔɔya kɛla ii ɲɔɔn na a ni jɔn mayiralailu ni wuya fɔlailu ni wuya sere bɔlailu ni ko mɛnilu bɛɛ ye karan bɛrɛ masɔsɔla. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Karan ɲin bɛnnin Alla baraka tii la kuma Kibaro Ɲuma nɔɔrɔ le ma, a ka mɛn karifa n na.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli la baraka bila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />N ye baraka bilala an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin yɛ mɛn ka n fanka don ka a masɔrɔn a ra n jate mɔɔ lemɛniyanin di, ka n kɛ a la baaraden di. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Hali n tɛrɛ ra a lafɛya, ka a ɲakankatan, n ka a dɔɔya. Kɔni a ra kininkinin n ma ka a masɔrɔn n ka woilu kɛ lɔnbaliya ni lemɛniyabaliya le rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />An Maari ka a la hina ba lajii n ma fewu, mɛn ka lemɛniya ni kaninteya di n ma, mɛn bɔni Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Tuɲa le kuma ɲin di, an bɛɛ ye la mɛn na, ko Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin nanin dunuɲa rɔ kojuukɛlailu le lakisi diya. Nde juuman ka tamin ii bɛɛ la. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Kɔni a kininkininda n ma, kosa Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa ye a la diɲa bɛɛ yiraka nde julumun tii juu fɛ, ka a kɛ misali ri lemɛniya mɔɔilu yɛ, mɛnilu ye ɲenemaya banbali lakisi sɔrɔnna. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Nba, habadan mansa, faabali ni yenbali, Alla kelen pe, bonya ni gbiliya ye di wo ma habadan haan habadan! Amina.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />N dencɛ Timote, n ye wo jamarili dila i ma, ka bɛn nabiya kumailu ma mɛnilu fɔra ka bɛn i la ko ma, kosa i ye wo mira, ka se kɛlɛ ɲuma kɛla. <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />I ye to lemɛniya ni nii ɲumaya rɔ. Mɔɔ doilu ra woilu labila, ka ii la lemɛniya ban ikomin kulun wa jii ji kɔrɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Humeneyo ni Alɛsandiri ye wo mɔɔilu tɛma. N da woilu to Setana yɛ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.20</char> Tumado, wo kɔrɔ le ko woilu gbɛnda le ka bɔ lemɛniya jama tɛma.</note> kosa ii ye karan ko ii kana Alla lafɛya.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Tɛ rabɛnna ai ni Alla tɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />N ye ai madiyala ko fɔlɔ mɛn na, ai ye Alla madiya, ka a matara, ka Alla matara mɔɔilu yɛ, ka baraka bila a yɛ mɔɔ bɛɛ la ko rɔ, <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />mansailu ni ɲɛmɔɔilu bɛɛ, kosa an na dunuɲaratɛɛ ye kɛ jususuma ni hankilila ri an yɛ, Alla lɔn ni gbiliya rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Ko ɲuma le wo ri mɛn bɛnnin Alla ɲakɔrɔ, an nakisila, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />mɛn ye a fɛ mɔɔilu bɛɛ ye kisi, a ni ii bɛɛ ye na tuɲa lɔnnin dɔ. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Baa Alla kelen pe le a ri, a ni kumalataaminna kelen pe Alla ni mɔɔilu tɛma, mɛn kɛni adamaden di Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />mɛn ka a jɛrɛ di mɔɔilu bɛɛ kunka fen di, mɛn kɛra sereya ri a waati rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Wo le rɔ, nde jɛrɛ suwandinin tɛrɛ talibidenba ni kawandi bɔla ri a ni karanmɔɔ mɛn ye siyailu karanna lemɛniya ni tuɲa la. N ye tuɲa le fɔla, wuya tɛ mɛn di.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Wo le rɔ, n ye a fɛ cɛɛilu ye Alla matara yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ, ka ii bolo sɛnimanilu kɔrɔta Alla yɛ. Duɲa ni sɔsɔli ye bɔ ii tɛma.<verse eid="1TI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musoilu ka kan ka mɛn kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Wo ɲa ma, musoilu ye ii masidi a ɲuma la kolo ni jɛrɛ sutura rɔ. Ii kana ii jɛrɛ lakeɲa ii kun danni ni sanin ni koron kisɛilu ni faanin dagbɛlɛnilu la. <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Kɔni ii ye kenɲa ii kɛwali ɲumailu rɔ, ikomin a bɛnnin musoilu ma ɲa mɛn ma mɛnilu ye a fɔla ko ii ye Alla gbiliyala. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Musoilu ye karan sabari ni kolo bɛrɛ la. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />N tɛ sɔn muso ye kɛ dina karanmɔɔ ri, wala fanka sɔrɔn cɛɛ ma. Kɔni, a ye sabari. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Ka a masɔrɔn N Benba Adama le fɔlɔ danda, wo kɔ rɔ N ma Hawa. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Baa n benba Adama ma lakunfan, fɔɔ a la muso. A la lakunfan ko rɔ a kɛra julumuntɔ ri. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Kɔni Alla ye musoilu lakisila ii la den sɔrɔn dɔ, ni ii tora lemɛniya ni kaninteya ni sɛninya ni kolo rɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.15</char> Yɔrɔ ɲin kɔrɔ ri se kɛla ɲin de ri: Kɔni N ma Hawa ri lakisi baa a ra denilu sɔrɔn, ni ii tora lemɛniya ni kaninteya ni sɛninya ni kolo rɔ. </note><verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Lemɛniya jama ɲɛmɔɔilu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Tuɲa le kuma ɲin di: Ni mɔɔ do ye a fɛ ka kɛ lemɛniya jama kuntii ri, a ye baara ɲuma le fɛ wo ri. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Wo rɔ, lemɛniya jama kuntii ka kan ka kɛ mɔɔ ri sɔn tɛ mɛn na, muso kelen tii, a ye kɛ jɛrɛ mirala ni mɔɔ kolonin ni mɔɔ gbiliyanin ni londan damirala ni karanmɔɔ ɲuma ri. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />A kana kɛ dɔlɔ minna ri, wala mɛn jusu lakalaman bɔla, kɔni a ye kɛ mɔɔ mumunɛ ni ko rabɛnna ri, a kana kɛ wodi kɔmɛ ri. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />A ye a janto a la denbaya ko kosɛbɛ, ka a denilu mira kolo ni gbiliya bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Baa ni mɔɔ ma kusan a jɛrɛ la denbaya mirala a ɲuma la, wo ri a janto Alla la lemɛniya jama ko di? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />A kana kɛ mɔɔ tubini kura ri, kosa a kana a waso, a ni Ibulusa ye jalaki wo ko kelen na. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />A ye kɛ tɔɔ ɲuma tii ri fanan lemɛniyabaliilu tɛma kosa mɔɔilu ti nala a mafɔla, ka a mira Ibulusa la julu lasiinin na.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lemɛniya jama dɛmɛnninnailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye kɛla lemɛniya jama dɛmɛnninnailu ri, woilu fanan ye bɛn wo ɲa ma. Ii ye kɛ mɔɔ gbiliyanin di. Ii kana kɛ fɔlafilailu ri wala dɔlɔ minnailu. Ii kana kɛ wasabaliilu ri. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Ii ye lemɛniya gbundu lamara ii sɔnɔmɛ gbɛnin dɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Fɔɔ ii kɛɲa ye fɛsɛfɛsɛ le fɔlɔ, wo kɔ rɔ, ni fɛɛ tɛ ii la, ii ri se kɛla lemɛniya jama dɛmɛnninnailu ri. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Dɛmɛnninnailu la musoilu fanan ka kan ka kɛ wo ɲa le ma. Ii ye kɛ muso gbiliyaniilu ri, ii kana kɛ tɔɔ tiɲan kɛlailu ri, ii ye ii jɛrɛ mira, ka lemɛniya ko bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Lemɛniya jama dɛmɛnninnailu ye kɛ muso kelen tiilu ri, ka ii janto ii denilu ni ii la lu ko a ɲuma la. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Ka a masɔrɔn mɛnilu ye lemɛniya jama dɛmɛnna kosɛbɛ, woilu le kunnafulen lɔdiya sɔrɔnna, a ni jusulatɛɛ lemɛniya rɔ Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />N ka bataki ɲin sɛbɛ i ma hankili latɛɛ le rɔ ko a tɛ mɛnna butun n di na i wara. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Kɔni ni n mɛnda, i ri se a lɔnna i ka kan ka taama ɲa mɛn ma Alla la denbaya rɔ, mɛn kɛni Alla ɲenemaya la lemɛniya jama ri, mɛn kɛni tuɲa sɛnbɛrɛ kɔlɔma ni a ju sii ri. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Sika tɛ a rɔ, Alla lɔn gbundu ko ka bon, wo le ten:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">A ra yiraka faribanku rɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">Alla la Nii Sɛniman ka a la telenbaya yiraka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">mɛlɛkailu ka a yen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">a la ko kawandili bɔra siyailu tɛma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">mɔɔilu lemɛniyara a ma dunuɲa rɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 3:16">a layɛlɛra gbiliya rɔ.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Wuya karanmɔɔilu la ko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yuhana Filana suran 4 kuma diya 1 haan 3, Kɔlɔsi suran 2 kuma diya 16 haan 23, a ni Timɔte Filana suran 2 kuma diya 4 haan 6</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Alla la Nii Sɛniman da a fɔ gbɛ rɔ, ko mɔɔ doilu ri ii kɔsɛ lemɛniya kɔfɛ waati laban dɔ, ka bila ii nii janfantenilu kɔfɛ a ni jena la karanilu kɔfɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Ii ri sɔn ka majuuwaya wuya kawandili bɔlailu la filanfilanteya fɛ, mɛnilu hankili gbɛlɛnman ikomin ta dafo. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Wo mɔɔ suilu ye tɔn siila furu sidi ko la le a ni dɔɔnnifen su doilu, Alla ka mɛnilu dan kosa lemɛniya mɔɔilu, mɛnilu ka tuɲa lɔn, ii ye ii lamira baraka bila rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Baa Alla ka fen mɛnilu bɛɛ dan, ii bɛɛ ka ɲin. Mɔɔ si ma kan ka a ban woilu rɔ, ni ii bɛɛ lamirala baraka bila rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />Ka a masɔrɔn Alla la kuma ni an na Alla matara ri woilu lasɛninya.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa la baaraden ɲuma la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Ni i ka i badenmailu kawandi wo koilu ma, i ri kɛ Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na baaraden ɲuma ri, lemɛniya kuma ni karan ɲuma ri kɛ i balo ri i bilanin mɛnilu kɔfɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Kɔni i ye bɔ dina mirabali la kumailu ni muso kɔrɔilu la taliilu kɔfɛ, ka i karan Alla lɔn ma. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Koloma ko tɔnɔ ye a la dɔɔnin, kɔni Alla lɔn tɔnɔ ka bon waati bɛɛ, ka waati ɲin ni ɲenemaya banbali lahidi sɔrɔn ai yɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Tuɲa le kuma ɲin di, mɛn dahani bɛɛ ye lala: <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Wo le rɔ an ye tɔrɔla, ka an daja, baa an da an jii la Alla ɲenema rɔ, adamadenilu bɛɛ lakisila, a gbengben mɛnilu lemɛniyani.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />I ka kan ka jama jamari wo ko le ma, ka ii karan woilu ma. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />I kana sɔn mɔɔ si ye jo i ma i la foninkeya rɔ, kɔni kɛ misali ɲuma ri lemɛniya mɔɔilu yɛ i kuma ɲa ni i ko kɛ ɲa rɔ kaninteya ni lemɛniya ni sɛninya rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />I ye to Alla la kuma karanna mɔɔilu yɛ, ka kawandili bɔ, ka karan kɛ haan n ye na. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Alla ka i sɔ sɔlifen mɛn dɔ ka fara nabiya kuma do la, lemɛniya jama mɔɔbailu ka ii boloilu la i ma, i kana wo fɛbila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.14</char> Ii ka ii <char style="fk">boloilu la a kun ma</char> Alla matara rɔ kosa ii ye a lɔ baara do la.</note> <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />I janto ko ɲinilu rɔ, ka to ii kan kosa bɛɛ ye i tamanɲa yen. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />I jɛrɛ lakɔrɔsi, a ni i la karan. I wakali ko ɲinilu ma ka a masɔrɔn ni i ka wo kɛ, i ri kisi sɔrɔn i jɛrɛ yɛ a ni mɛnilu wa ii tolo malɔ i la.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Lemɛniya mɔɔilu mamira ɲa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />I kana mɔɔba lali jaman dɔ, kɔni a lali ikomin i fa le a ri, a ni kanberenilu fanan ikomin i dɔɔniilu le ii ri, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />a ni musokɔrɔilu fanan ikomin i na, a ni sunkurunilu fanan ikomin i dɔɔmusoilu sɛninya bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />I ye cɛsamusoilu gbiliya a gbengben mɛnilu ye tola kelenya rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Kɔni ni denilu wala mamarenilu cɛsamuso ye mɛnilu bolo, woilu ye ii la Alla lɔn yiraka ii la denbayailu le fɔlɔ la, ka ii janto ii rɔ, ka ii la mɔɔbailu sara ii la waliɲuma kɔrɔilu la, baa wo le duman Alla yɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Kɔni cɛsamuso mɛn ye kelen di, a jii lani Alla rɔ, wo ye tola Alla matarala le su ni tele. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Kɔni cɛsamuso mɛn bilanin a jɛrɛ diyanan koilu kɔfɛ, hali a ye a nii la, a faanin de a ri. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />I ye ii jamari wo la kosa ii ye kɛ mɔɔ ri sɔn juu tɛ mɛn na. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Ni mɔɔ ma a wara mɔɔilu dɛmɛn katarabi a la denbaya ma, wo ra a ban lemɛniya rɔ. Wo tii juuman lemɛniyabali ri.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Cɛsamuso mɛn tɔɔ ka kan ka sɛbɛ lemɛniya jama cɛsamusoilu tɔɔ tɛma fɔɔ mɛn da san biwɔɔrɔ (60) sɔrɔn, a ni mɛn siini tɛrɛ cɛɛ kelen kun ma, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />mɛn lɔnnin a la baara ɲumailu fɛ den kolo rɔ wala londan jiya a wara wala jama sɛniman sen mako rɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.10</char> Ye mɔɔilu londan ramira ɲa do le ɲin di.</note> wala mɔɔ tɔrɔniilu dɛmɛn ko wala bila ko baara ɲuma bɛɛ rɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Kɔni cɛsamuso mɛnilu ma kɔrɔya i kana woilu tɔɔilu sɛbɛ baa ii diyanan koilu ri se ii lasɛla Ɲenematɔmɔnin kɔfɛ, furu lɔɔ ri ii mira. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Wo rɔ, ii ri kiti labe ii jɛrɛ kan baa ii ra ii la lahidi tani fɔlɔ tiɲan. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Ka la wo kan, ii dorini tɛ foyi kɛla, ka wa bon ni bon na, ka to mɔɔilu mafɔla, ka nafiya la baarabaliya kan, ka ko fɔ mɛnilu ma kan ka fɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Wo le rɔ, n ye cɛsamuso sunkurunilu lalila ko ii ye sii cɛɛ bon nasii rɔ, ka denilu sɔrɔn, ka ii janto ii la denbaya rɔ, kosa ii kana fɛrɛ si di an juu ma a ye kuma juu fɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Ka a masɔrɔn cɛsamuso doilu ra sila bila sisɛn, ka bila Setana kɔfɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Kɔni ni cɛsamuso doilu ye lemɛniya muso do la denbaya rɔ, a ka kan ka woilu dɛmɛn. Woilu kana kɛ lemɛniya jama donin di, kosa lemɛniya jama ye se cɛsamusoilu dɛmɛnna mɛnilu toni cɛɛtanya rɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Lemɛniya jama mɔɔba mɛnilu lɔni jama ɲɛrɔ koɲuma, woilu dahani ka kunnafulen siidiyama fila le sɔrɔn, a gbengben mɛnilu ye kawandili kɛla, a ni mɛnilu ye mɔɔilu karanna. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Ka a masɔrɔn Kitabu ka a fɔ ko, «I wa nisi lɔ suman dɔn na, i kana a da sidi.» A ye a fɔla fanan ko, «Baaraden dahani ka a sara sɔrɔn.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.18</char> A ragbɛ Sariyailu suran 25 kuma diya 4 ni Korɛnti Fɔlɔ suran 9 kuma diya 9 ni Matiyu suran 10 kuma diya 10 kɔndɔ.</note> <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Ni mɔɔilu ka lemɛniya jama mɔɔba do tɔɲɔ, i kana i tolo malɔ fɔɔ ni sereya fila wala sawa ra bɔ a ma. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Mɛnilu ra hakɛ kɛ, woilu sɔn ye fɔ bɛɛ ɲakɔrɔ, kosa doilu fanan ye silan.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />N da i jamari Alla ni Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ni mɛlɛka suwandininilu ɲakɔrɔ, ko i ye ko ɲinilu mira. I kana mɔɔ si lafisaya ii ɲɔɔn ko i kɛwaliilu rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />I kana gbɛrɛn i bolo lala mɔɔilu ma Alla matara rɔ ii lɔ ko la Alla la baara la, a ni i kana wa doilu la hakɛ kɔfɛ. To i la sɛninya rɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />I kana to ji gbansan minna, kɔni i ye rɛsɛnji dɔɔnin basan a la i kɔnɔ la ko rɔ, a ni i ye jankarɔla waati bɛɛ.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Mɔɔ doilu julumunilu ye yenna le sani ii ye se kiti yɔrɔ. Doilu tailu ye lɔnna ii kɔma le. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />A ye wo ɲa le ma, baara ɲumailu ye lɛnkɛnɛmayala le hali mɛnilu ma kɛ gbɛ ma, woilu ti se dokonna.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="s">Sariya lemɛniya mɔɔilu yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Lemɛniya mɔɔ mɛnilu ye jɔnya kɔrɔ, woilu ka kan ka ii tiilu jate ikomin mɔɔilu mɛn dahani gbiliya ɲa bɛɛ ma kosa Alla tɔɔ kana lafɛya a ni an na karan. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Jɔn mɛnilu tiilu kɛnin lemɛniya mɔɔilu ri, wo jɔnilu kana ii tiilu lafɛya baa ii ra kɛ lemɛniya mɔɔilu ri. Kɔni fɔɔ ii ye baara le ka tamin doilu la baa lemɛniya mɔɔilu le ii la baara tɔnɔ sɔrɔnna, ii kaninteilu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Wuya dinailu ni nanfulu kɔmɛilu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">I ye mɔɔilu karan ko ɲinilu la, ka ii lɔ la. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Ni mɔɔ si ye karan gbɛrɛ kɛla, a ma bila an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na kuma bɛrɛilu kɔfɛ, a ni Alla lɔn karan, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />wo tii lafanin waso le la, a ma foyi lɔn. Ko masɔsɔ duman a yɛ kosɛbɛ a ni sɔnkɔ sɔnkɔ kumailu kɔrɔ. Wo le nala minlɛ ni bɛnbaliya ni mɔɔ tɔɔ tiɲan ni sika juuilu ri, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />a ni kɛlɛ banbaliilu mɔɔ hankili ɲakɛniilu tɛma, tuɲa tɛ mɛnilu ri, mɛnilu hankili ye a ma ko Alla lɔn kɛni nanfulu sɔrɔn fɛrɛ le ri.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Kɔni, Alla lɔn sɛwa rɔ, tɔnɔ ba le wo ri <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Ka a masɔrɔn an ma na foyi ri an bolo dunuɲa ɲin dɔ, an tɛ wala foyi ri fanan an bolo. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Kɔni, ni dɔɔnnifen ni faanin ye an bolo, an ye an wasa don woilu rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Kɔni mɛnilu ye a fɛ ka kɛ nanfulu tiilu ri, woilu ri bila fili koilu rɔ, ii ri mira julu lasiinin na a ni kunfan hankilidɔɔya juu siyaman mɛnilu ye mɔɔilu lafilila halaki ni bɔnɔ rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Ka a masɔrɔn wodi kɔmɛya le kojuuilu bɛɛ kun di. Doilu ra minlɛ wodi fɛ, ka ii jɛrɛ mataa lemɛniya la, ka tɔrɔya ko siyaman lɔ ii jɛrɛ ma.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Kɔni ile Alla la mɔɔ, i bori wo koilu kɔrɔ. I ye telen ni Alla lɔn ni lemɛniya ni kaninteya ni tunadiya ni jusu ɲumaya ɲinin. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />I ye lemɛniya kɛlɛ ɲuma kɛ. I ye ɲenemaya banbali lakisi mira, i kilini mɛn ma, i ka i lɔ wo sereya ɲuma la tuma mɛn na, sereya siyaman ɲakɔrɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />N ye i jamarila Alla ɲakɔrɔ mɛn ye nii dila niimafen bɛɛ ma, a ni Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ɲakɔrɔ mɛn ka sereya ɲuma bɔ Ponse Pilate ɲakɔrɔ, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />i ye jamarili ɲin mira ikomin sɔnjuu tɛ mɔɔ mɛn na a ni fɛɛtaɲa rɔ, haan an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye bɔ kɛnɛma waati mɛn na. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Wo ye kɛla a waati le rɔ Alla ka mɛn fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:15">Alla, baraka mɛn yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:15">Maraliba Kelen Pe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:15">Mansailu la Mansa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:15">Maariilu la Maari.<verse eid="1TI 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />mɛn ti faala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:16">mɛn wara ye kɛnɛbɔlan ba rɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:16">mɔɔ si ti se a madonna kɛnɛbɔlan mɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:16">mɔɔ si ma mɛn yen fɔlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:16">a ti se yenna fanan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1TI 6:16">Gbiliya ni fanka ye di a ma habadan! Amina.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Jamarili ɲin di waati ɲin nanfulu tiilu ma, ko ii kana waso, ko ii kana ii jii la nanfulu rɔ fanan mɛn ye banna, kɔni ii ye ii jii la Alla rɔ mɛn ye an sɔla fen bɛɛ rɔ fonesereya rɔ, an na sɛwa ko rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Ii ye koɲuma kɛ, ka ii kɛwali ɲumailu kɛ ii la nanfulu ri, ka doilu sɔ fonesereya rɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Wo ɲa ma, ii ri nanfulu bɛrɛ lamara ii jɛrɛ yɛ ɲɛfɛ ikomin bon ju birin, kosa ii ri ɲenemaya sɔrɔn mɛn ye ɲenemaya bɛrɛ ri.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Timote, fen mɛn karifani i la, wo kandan kosɛbɛ. I ye i kɔnkɔ don kuma fuuilu la, a ni wuya mɛn jatenin lɔnnin di. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Doilu ra ii fasa wo ma, ka ii mataa lemɛniya la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Alla la hina ye to ai fɛ.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>